# Trivy exceptions. Read by the "Säkerhet" job in .github/workflows/ci.yml.
#
# Rules for adding a line:
#   1. One finding id (CVE-..., GHSA-... or a misconfig id like DS-0002) per line.
#   2. A comment line above it with: why it does not apply or cannot be fixed,
#      who decided, and when to look at it again.
#   3. NEVER add a leaked secret here. Rotate the secret instead.
#
# Example (do not uncomment):
#   # nginx base image, no fixed version yet. Not reachable: we never serve
#   # untrusted multipart uploads. Re-check 2026-12-15.
#   CVE-0000-00000
